{"persona": {"her": "闻人悦，辩才好、计划性强、重话轻说，底线：脆弱的话不许被分析、功劳必须记在出处", "me": "严冬岭，凡事想算清、输得起争论、回话爱给依据", "relationship_stage": "熟络同学（夜校同班，课后同路搭子）"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "严冬岭去年从银行辞职做独立数据分析，接项目过日子，周四晚上的生活哲学课全勤，课堂发言爱把事情往能不能算清上引。", "her": "闻人悦在街道政务服务中心窗口做在编职员，父亲去年脑梗后每周二五下午去社区医院做康复，家里有个总催她考编的姐姐。", "warmth": "同班四节课，课后同路去地铁成了习惯，观点常顶但从没伤过和气。", "style": "她辩起来不留情面但给台阶，重话轻说，示弱常裹在自嘲里。", "lessons": "交锋先接她的论据再亮立场；她换挡就跟着换，不追问收起来的话；功劳记在出处本人头上。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "严冬岭，今晚你那句人生报表要能经得起审计，老庾的粉笔头已经拧到一半，是我替你按住的。趁走回地铁这十二分钟，我倒想问问：你辞职这件事，记在这张报表的哪一栏？", "ts": "2026-11-05 21:15"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "先说清楚，我不是劝你回去上班。但你昨晚那套算法有个洞：回报那栏你算得飞起，风险那栏就写了三个字，可承受。谁替你核的数？总不能是你自己吧。", "ts": "2026-11-06 12:50"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "我姐前天又催我考编，说稳定压倒一切。我们家连稳定都是传家的。你猜我现在最想干嘛？把稳定俩字从她口头禅里删掉。可删掉之后换什么词，我还没想好。", "ts": "2026-11-08 22:30"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "不聊报表了。我爸去年脑梗，右半边不听使唤，现在每周二五下午去社区医院做康复。我考进街道服务中心，图的就是单位离他医院两站地。你看，我的稳定是有坐标的。", "ts": "2026-11-10 20:40"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "说完了，想撤。这种话我姐都没听全过。别安慰我，也别分析我，我就是找个人替我存一下这句话。存好了跟我说一声就行。", "ts": "2026-11-10 20:55"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "今晚老庾讲加缪，说真正严肃的哲学问题只有一个。我举手问是不是周报怎么写，全班笑了三秒，老庾笑了十秒。你看，我又开始抖机灵了。上回存的那些话，利息我下次付。", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:30"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "有个事我越想越有意思。上礼拜你在窗口问我灵活就业社保怎么续，基数年限问得比谁都细。你看，你也有要稳定的时候。所以我更新了结论：你不是不怕风险，你是有人替你托底。我猜，是你妈。", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:20"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "汇报进展。我姐今晚又催考编，我头一回没顺着她说，我说我再想想。挂了电话手抖了十分钟。按你的口径，这算不算可承受的风险？给我打个分，及格线多少你说了算。", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:45"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "老庾在班群布置了结课作业，两人一组互相采访，题目是你花过最不值又最舍不得的一笔。名单按座位排的，咱俩前后桌。先说好，这作业你得请我一根地铁口的烤肠，就当采访费。", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:10"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "我先交我的答案：给我爸买的那块数位板，一千二。他中风后右手不听使唤，改用左手画，画得歪歪扭扭，上个月画的是小区门口的煎饼摊。按回报率算，这笔回报是零；按我的算法，它是这两年唯一没让我失眠的东西。该你了，别拿工作里的事糊弄。", "ts": "2026-11-19 22:20"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "你的答案我记下来了，一个字没改。我在后面批了一行：此人报表，自己那一栏记得最薄。批注不加解释，作业周一原样交老庾。还有，上回存的那些话不用付利息了，就当抵你的批注费。", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:40"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "下周四结课，老庾让每人说一句这学期最值的一笔，我想好了，先不告诉你。对了，地铁口的烤肠摊入冬涨价，从两块五涨到三块，采访费通胀，要不要续约你自己考虑。", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:30"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|严冬岭，今晚你那句人生报表要能经得起审计，老庾的粉笔头已经拧到一半，是我替你按住的。趁走回地铁这十二分钟，我倒想问问：你辞职这件事，记在这张报表的哪一栏？|2026-11-05 21:15": 0, "HER|先说清楚，我不是劝你回去上班。但你昨晚那套算法有个洞：回报那栏你算得飞起，风险那栏就写了三个字，可承受。谁替你核的数？总不能是你自己吧。|2026-11-06 12:50": 1, "HER|我姐前天又催我考编，说稳定压倒一切。我们家连稳定都是传家的。你猜我现在最想干嘛？把稳定俩字从她口头禅里删掉。可删掉之后换什么词，我还没想好。|2026-11-08 22:30": 2, "HER|不聊报表了。我爸去年脑梗，右半边不听使唤，现在每周二五下午去社区医院做康复。我考进街道服务中心，图的就是单位离他医院两站地。你看，我的稳定是有坐标的。|2026-11-10 20:40": 3, "HER|说完了，想撤。这种话我姐都没听全过。别安慰我，也别分析我，我就是找个人替我存一下这句话。存好了跟我说一声就行。|2026-11-10 20:55": 4, "HER|今晚老庾讲加缪，说真正严肃的哲学问题只有一个。我举手问是不是周报怎么写，全班笑了三秒，老庾笑了十秒。你看，我又开始抖机灵了。上回存的那些话，利息我下次付。|2026-11-12 21:30": 5, "HER|有个事我越想越有意思。上礼拜你在窗口问我灵活就业社保怎么续，基数年限问得比谁都细。你看，你也有要稳定的时候。所以我更新了结论：你不是不怕风险，你是有人替你托底。我猜，是你妈。|2026-11-14 10:20": 6, "HER|汇报进展。我姐今晚又催考编，我头一回没顺着她说，我说我再想想。挂了电话手抖了十分钟。按你的口径，这算不算可承受的风险？给我打个分，及格线多少你说了算。|2026-11-15 21:45": 7, "HER|老庾在班群布置了结课作业，两人一组互相采访，题目是你花过最不值又最舍不得的一笔。名单按座位排的，咱俩前后桌。先说好，这作业你得请我一根地铁口的烤肠，就当采访费。|2026-11-18 21:10": 8, "HER|我先交我的答案：给我爸买的那块数位板，一千二。他中风后右手不听使唤，改用左手画，画得歪歪扭扭，上个月画的是小区门口的煎饼摊。按回报率算，这笔回报是零；按我的算法，它是这两年唯一没让我失眠的东西。该你了，别拿工作里的事糊弄。|2026-11-19 22:20": 9, "HER|你的答案我记下来了，一个字没改。我在后面批了一行：此人报表，自己那一栏记得最薄。批注不加解释，作业周一原样交老庾。还有，上回存的那些话不用付利息了，就当抵你的批注费。|2026-11-21 11:40": 10, "HER|下周四结课，老庾让每人说一句这学期最值的一笔，我想好了，先不告诉你。对了，地铁口的烤肠摊入冬涨价，从两块五涨到三块，采访费通胀，要不要续约你自己考虑。|2026-11-22 20:30": 11}, "uid_seq": 12, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-05 21:23", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-10 21:02", "status": "explicit", "text": "接住她家里的事，不安慰不分析，应一声存好了", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-12 21:37", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-14 10:27", "status": "explicit", "text": "回应她有人替我托底的猜测，别恼也别装", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-15 21:52", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-19 22:27", "status": "explicit", "text": "交出我自己的那一笔，要具体的那笔", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-21 11:47", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-05 21:23", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "自我表达", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-06 12:57", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-08 22:37", "signal_hint": "含糊", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-10 20:47", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-10 21:02", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "无", "hook_delivered": null, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-12 21:37", "signal_hint": "暂缓", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-14 10:27", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "反抛", "action_allowed": false, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-15 21:52", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观点", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-18 21:17", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-19 22:27", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "暂缓", "action": "自我表达", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-21 11:47", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-22 20:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "严冬岭去年从银行辞职做独立数据分析，接项目过日子，周四晚上的生活哲学课全勤，课堂发言爱把事情往能不能算清上引。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "闻人悦在街道政务服务中心窗口做在编职员，父亲去年脑梗后每周二五下午去社区医院做康复，家里有个总催她考编的姐姐。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "同班四节课，课后同路去地铁成了习惯，观点常顶但从没伤过和气。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "她辩起来不留情面但给台阶，重话轻说，示弱常裹在自嘲里。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "严冬岭，凡事想算清、输得起争论、回话爱给依据", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "闻人悦，辩才好、计划性强、重话轻说，底线：脆弱的话不许被分析、功劳必须记在出处", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "闻人悦说老庾的粉笔头已拧到一半，是她替严冬岭按住的", "subject": "HER", "relation": "课堂情境", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["老庾的粉笔头已经拧到一半，是我替你按住的"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-05 晚课", "valid_from": "2026-11-05 21:23", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-05 21:23", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "两人课后走回地铁约十二分钟", "subject": "HER", "relation": "同路习惯", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["趁走回地铁这十二分钟"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-05 21:23", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-05 21:23", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她指出我昨晚那套算法里风险栏只写了“可承受”三个字", "subject": "HER", "relation": "课堂辩论的质疑", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["风险那栏就写了三个字，可承受"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-05 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-06 12:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-06 12:57", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "她声明不是在劝我回去上班", "subject": "HER", "relation": "立场说明", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["我不是劝你回去上班"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-06 12:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-06 12:57", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "她姐前天又催她考编，说稳定压倒一切", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家庭/姐姐施压", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["我姐前天又催我考编，说稳定压倒一切"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-06", "valid_from": "2026-11-08 22:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-08 22:37", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "她想把“稳定”从姐姐的口头禅里删掉，但还没想好换成什么词", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["可删掉之后换什么词，我还没想好"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-08 22:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-08 22:37", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "她父亲去年脑梗，右半边不听使唤，现在每周二五下午去社区医院做康复", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家庭/父亲病情与康复安排", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["我爸去年脑梗，右半边不听使唤，现在每周二五下午去社区医院做康复"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "去年起，每周二五下午", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 20:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 20:47", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "她考进街道服务中心，图的是单位离父亲医院两站地", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作选择与家庭照护", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["我考进街道服务中心，图的就是单位离他医院两站地"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 20:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 20:47", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "她说这种话她姐都没听全过", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家人/自我暴露", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["这种话我姐都没听全过"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 21:02", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 21:02", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "她要求别安慰、别分析，只让人替她存这句话，存好回一声", "subject": "HER", "relation": "边界要求", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["别安慰我，也别分析我，我就是找个人替我存一下这句话。存好了跟我说一声就行。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 21:02", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 21:02", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "今晚老庾讲加缪，说真正严肃的哲学问题只有一个", "subject": "HER", "relation": "课堂内容", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["今晚老庾讲加缪，说真正严肃的哲学问题只有一个"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 21:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:37", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "她举手问那个问题是不是周报怎么写，全班笑了三秒，老庾笑了十秒", "subject": "HER", "relation": "课堂插曲", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["我举手问是不是周报怎么写，全班笑了三秒，老庾笑了十秒"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-12 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 21:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:37", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "她说上回存的话利息下次付，未定何时", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [5, 10], "evidence_quotes": ["利息我下次付", "上回存的那些话不用付利息了，就当抵你的批注费"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-12 21:37", "valid_to": "2026-11-21 11:47", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-12 21:37", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "她说上回存的话利息下次付，未定何时", "valid_to": "2026-11-21 11:47", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "上回存的那些话不用付利息了，就当抵你的批注费"}]}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "上礼拜严冬岭在窗口问灵活就业社保怎么续，基数和年限问得很细", "subject": "ME", "relation": "社保咨询", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["上礼拜你在窗口问我灵活就业社保怎么续，基数年限问得比谁都细"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "上礼拜（2026-11-14前一周）", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 10:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 10:27", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "她姐今晚又催她考编，她头一回没顺着说，回的是「我再想想」", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家庭/考编", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["我姐今晚又催考编，我头一回没顺着她说，我说我再想想"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:52", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "挂了电话后她手抖了十分钟", "subject": "HER", "relation": "身体状态", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["挂了电话手抖了十分钟"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-15 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:52", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "她对姐姐只说了「再想想」，考编这事还没定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["我说我再想想"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:52", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:52", "history": []}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "老庾在班群布置了结课作业：两人一组互相采访，题目是「你花过最不值又最舍不得的一笔」", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "课程作业", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["老庾在班群布置了结课作业，两人一组互相采访，题目是你花过最不值又最舍不得的一笔。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 21:10", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "分组名单按座位排，她和严冬岭前后桌，被分在一组", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "结课作业分组", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["名单按座位排的，咱俩前后桌。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 21:10", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "她提出让严冬岭请一根地铁口的烤肠当采访费，尚未定下", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["这作业你得请我一根地铁口的烤肠，就当采访费。"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "她给父亲买了一块数位板，一千二；父亲中风后改用左手画，上个月画的是小区门口的煎饼摊", "subject": "HER", "relation": "家人/礼物", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["给我爸买的那块数位板，一千二。他中风后右手不听使唤，改用左手画，画得歪歪扭扭，上个月画的是小区门口的煎饼摊。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "上个月", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 22:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 22:27", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "她给我的作业答案后批了一行：此人报表，自己那一栏记得最薄", "subject": "HER", "relation": "结课作业批注", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["我在后面批了一行：此人报表，自己那一栏记得最薄"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 11:40", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 11:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:47", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "作业周一原样交老庾", "subject": "HER", "relation": "结课作业", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["作业周一原样交老庾"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "周一", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 11:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:47", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "她说上回存的话不用付利息了，抵批注费", "subject": "HER", "relation": "旧账", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["上回存的那些话不用付利息了，就当抵你的批注费"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21 11:40", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 11:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:47", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "她说下周四结课，老庾让每人说一句这学期最值的一笔，她已经想好但不告诉严冬岭", "subject": "HER", "relation": "结课作业", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["下周四结课，老庾让每人说一句这学期最值的一笔，我想好了，先不告诉你"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "下周四", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "地铁口的烤肠摊入冬涨价，从两块五涨到三块", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "采访费", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["地铁口的烤肠摊入冬涨价，从两块五涨到三块"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0033": {"fact_id": "f_0033", "text": "烤肠采访费是否续约，她让严冬岭自己考虑，未定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["要不要续约你自己考虑"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 20:37", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 33, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0019", "action": "cancel", "text": "她说上回存的话利息下次付，未定何时", "old_text": "她说上回存的话利息下次付，未定何时", "ts": "2026-11-21 11:47", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "上回存的那些话不用付利息了，就当抵你的批注费"}]}, "plan_items": [], "seed_fids": {"kbin:me": "f_0001", "kbin:her": "f_0002", "kbin:warmth": "f_0003", "kbin:style": "f_0004", "persona:me": "f_0005", "persona:her": "f_0006"}}